The problem is that the Wiz actually creates new bodies.  So even
if you destroy the old body, he can make a new one.
What you have to do (ONE OF THE BIGGEST SPOILERS IN THE GAME FOLLOWS)
to keep the wizard from following you is--->

Hint: Use a property of one of the items in the game.

Bigger Hint: An item that you can throw at monsters

Sure You Want To Know?: It's something that freezes monsters if you throw
                        it at them.

Really Sure You Want This?: It's a potion of paralysis.  If you want
                            to find out exactly want to do, hit space now.

Stand on the stairs going up.  Wait for the wiz to appear.  Throw the
potion at him.  He will be paralyzed.  Now rush up the stairs.  Normally
he'd only be frozen for about 30 moves, but the game stops
counting for monsters as soon as you go up to the next level.  So
as long as you're on a different level, he'll stay frozen.

